<title>FRANCE: French M3 money supply fell 0.4 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>French M3 money supply fell 0.4 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France gave the following money supply figures:</p>
<p> Money measure  Billions   Monthly change    12-month change</p>
<p>(end-Feb)	 (unadj)	(adjusted)	  (unadjusted)</p>
<p>				    Feb    Jan		 Feb</p>
<p>    M1	    1,642.1     0.7    -2.4		1.7</p>
<p>    M2	    3,224.4     1.0    -0.5		4.5</p>
<p>    M3	    5,191.6    -0.4     0.1	     -3.0</p>
<p>    M4	    5,282.0    -0.4     0.2	     -2.8</p>
<p>Investment</p>
<p>    P1	    1,984.8     1.0     1.7	     16.8</p>
</text>
